{"type":0,"army":0,"x":8,"y":37},{"type":0,"army":0,"x":11,"y":37},{"type":0,"army":0,"x":14,"y":37},{"type":0,"army":0,"x":18,"y":37},{"type":0,"army":0,"x":20,"y":37},{"type":0,"army":0,"x":24,"y":37},{"type":0,"army":0,"x":26,"y":37},{"type":0,"army":0,"x":32,"y":37},{"type":0,"army":0,"x":34,"y":37},{"type":0,"army":0,"x":38,"y":37},{"type":0,"army":0,"x":40,"y":37},{"type":0,"army":0,"x":44,"y":37},{"type":0,"army":0,"x":46,"y":37},{"type":0,"army":0,"x":50,"y":37}],"arrivals":[{"turn":5,"army":1,"units":[{"type":33,"x":1,"y":20,"cargo":[9,9,10]},{"type":34,"x":1,"y":26,"cargo":[8,9,66]},{"type":39,"x":2,"y":18},{"type":39,"x":2,"y":28},{"type":49,"x":1,"y":23},{"type":71,"x":2,"y":22,"level":4},{"type":2,"x":3,"y":24},{"type":69,"x":3,"y":21,"level":4}]},{"turn":9,"army":1,"units":[{"type":30,"x":59,"y":22},{"type":30,"x":59,"y":28},{"type":42,"x":58,"y":20},{"type":42,"x":58,"y":30},{"type":60,"x":57,"y":24,"level":7},{"type":60,"x":57,"y":26,"level":7},{"type":60,"x":58,"y":25,"level":7},{"type":43,"x":59,"y":25}]},{"turn":14,"army":1,"units":[{"type":32,"x":12,"y":1},{"type":32,"x":48,"y":1},{"type":72,"x":16,"y":2,"level":5},{"type":72,"x":44,"y":2,"level":5},{"type":73,"x":26,"y":1,"level":6},{"type":73,"x":38,"y":1,"level":6},{"type":73,"x":41,"y":2,"level":6},{"type":60,"x":24,"y":2,"level":8},{"type":60,"x":40,"y":1,"level":8},{"type":60,"x":20,"y":1,"level":8},{"type":60,"x":46,"y":2,"level":8}]},{"turn":19,"army":1,"units":[{"type":31,"x":52,"y":1},{"type":31,"x":8,"y":1},{"type":42,"x":55,"y":2},{"type":42,"x":4,"y":2},{"type":70,"x":57,"y":6,"level":5},{"type":70,"x":2,"y":5,"level":5},{"type":68,"x":15,"y":6,"level":5},{"type":67,"x":50,"y":3,"level":5}]},{"turn":7,"army":0,"units":[{"type":30,"x":2,"y":34},{"type":31,"x":3,"y":31},{"type":31,"x":2,"y":37},{"type":42,"x":4,"y":33},{"type":42,"x":5,"y":36},{"type":2,"x":6,"y":31},{"type":2,"x":6,"y":37},{"type":2,"x":4,"y":29},{"type":4,"x":7,"y":34},{"type":4,"x":7,"y":30}]},{"turn":11,"army":0,"when":{"choice":"deal"},"units":[{"type":34,"x":58,"y":34,"cargo":[8,9,9]},{"type":33,"x":57,"y":31,"cargo":[8,8]},{"type":36,"x":58,"y":37},{"type":36,"x":56,"y":36},{"type":66,"x":55,"y":30},{"type":67,"x":54,"y":34},{"type":50,"x":56,"y":29},{"type":50,"x":53,"y":37}]},{"turn":11,"army":0,"when":{"choice":"refuse"},"units":[{"type":58,"x":58,"y":34,"cargo":[8,9,9]},{"type":30,"x":57,"y":31},{"type":42,"x":58,"y":37},{"type":42,"x":56,"y":36},{"type":2,"x":55,"y":30},{"type":2,"x":54,"y":34},{"type":1,"x":56,"y":29},{"type":1,"x":53,"y":37}]}],"objective":{"kind":"flagship","type":77},"general":{"x":31,"y":35},"turnLimit":40,"cap":40,"music":29,"briefing":"Earth's shadow. The far side of everything.\n\nEleven years ago, Asgard's yards laid down two hulls. One became Babylon. The other was never finished, never named in any Union record, and never found. She has a name now: Nineveh. And she has a captain who was never found either.\n\nAhriman is alive. While we were fighting Kessrin, he was salvaging the main cannon Babylon never fired, and fitting it to her sister. Everything Galt still has is drawn up in front of her: battleships, carriers, the last Abaddons, and his own guard in machines we taught Kessrin to build.\n\nThree towers on her hull feed the cannon. At every phase it fires straight down three lanes, and nothing in them survives. Kill the towers and the lanes go dark.\n\nThis is the last fleet in space that is not ours. Bring everything.","goal":"Sink the Nineveh within 40 turns. Her cannon fires down three lanes at every phase change until its towers fall. If the general falls, it is over.","routes":[{"prio":1,"x":14,"y":19},{"prio":1,"x":26,"y":18},{"prio":1,"x":42,"y":19},{"prio":1,"x":20,"y":26},{"prio":1,"x":40,"y":27},{"prio":1,"x":31,"y":30}],"ending":"The Nineveh's cannon fires one last time, into nothing, as her hull breaks along the seams the Asgard welders left eleven years ago.\n\nThere is no transmission at the end. Ahriman never begged in the old war, and he does not begin now.\n\nThe fleets drift in Earth's shadow, Union and Galt and cartel, and for the first time since the parade at Olympos nobody fires. Somebody on an open channel starts reading out the names of ships, and nobody tells them to stop.\n\nThe war is over. This time, all of it.","chapter":"Chapter 13 · Secret · Earth's shadow","transmission":"You sank my Babylon before she could speak, General. Her sister has been waiting eleven years to finish the sentence.","strategy":["Deploy everything you can: forty machines. Keep the general's ship in the middle of the formation, far from the lanes at columns 22, 29 and 36.","The cannon fires at every phase change down each lane whose tower still stands. Cross a lane during a move, but never end a move in one.","The towers sit on Nineveh's hull. Only craft can climb onto the hull; send fighters and mecha through the gaps in the gravity veil to kill them, while the capital ships hold the line south of the veil.","Clear the minefields with long guns before advancing; the mines block the gaps.","Reserves come on turns 6 (west), 10 (east), 15 (from behind the hull) and 20. A loyal Union fleet joins you on turn 8 from the south-west, and on turn 12 Moraine's cartel or the Olympos guard.","The Nineveh holds in her hull until turn 26 and launches her fighters when you come close. Her guns reach six hexes; take her apart from the hull's edge with railguns and missiles."],"plan":[{"n":1,"path":[[8,33],[10,24],[14,19]]},{"n":1,"path":[[52,33],[50,24],[42,19]]},{"n":2,"at":[26,18],"note":"Veil gap"},{"n":3,"at":[22,12],"note":"Tower"},{"n":3,"at":[29,10],"note":"Tower"},{"n":3,"at":[36,6],"note":"Tower"},{"n":4,"at":[30,7],"note":"Nineveh"},{"n":5,"at":[2,30],"note":"Union fleet T8"}],"comms":[{"speaker":"ahriman","text":"You sank my Babylon before she could speak, General. Her sister has been waiting eleven years to finish the sentence."},{"speaker":"ruess","text":"That's Babylon's main cannon in her bow. They salvaged it while we were busy with Kessrin. Three towers on the hull feed it; each one fires straight down its column, every phase, and anything in the lane is gone. Ours or theirs."},{"speaker":"sato","text":"Then we don't stand in the lanes. Cross them on the move, never stop in them. Kill the towers and the lanes go dark. The veil in front of the hull stops the mecha; use the three gaps."},{"speaker":"moraine","text":"I always wondered who bought all those Asgard spare parts. Ahriman pays in gold, General. You pay in futures. Guess whose side I'm on today."},{"speaker":"ahriman","text":"The Union, the Directorate, the cartel: you are all the same children. Come, then. Bring everything. It will be easier to bury you together."}],"cannons":[{"x":22,"y":13,"tower":[22,12]},{"x":29,"y":11,"tower":[29,10]},{"x":36,"y":7,"tower":[36,6]}]}